                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجِىَ</span></b> 
                         and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوَجَّى</span></b>  [said of a man, or of
a horse or the like, or of a camel] <i>His foot,</i> or
<i>hoof,</i> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِرْسِن</span>, <i>was,</i> or <i>became, attenuated, and
chafed,</i> or <i>abraded:</i> (TA:) or <i>he</i> (a horse)
<i>experienced a pain in his hoof.</i> (S.)

